    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32678" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏpĕrōsĭtas</span></b> ,
			ātis, f.
		operosus, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>excessive pains</i>, <i>overmuch
				nicety</i>, <i>elaborate workmanship</i>
			(post-Aug.): est etiam, quae <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιεργία</span> vocatur, supervacua, ut sic
			dixerim, operositas, <i><span class="en">Quint. 8, 3, 55</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">operositas suadendi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tert. Anim. 2 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitreorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vop. Tac. 11</span></i>
			.</div>
